{
 "slug": "138dinghuidengchi",
 "title": "念佛人的定慧等持",
 "author": "湛然",
 "school": "xiuxue",
 "illustration": "bell",
 "excerpt": "问：我已成就念念相续，请问下一步怎样修学？",
 "chars": 2320,
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
